#: package/nss/luci-app-nss/htdocs/luci-static/resources/view/nss/status.js:131
msgid ""
"Packets through the firmware's Wi-Fi data path since boot, per radio. \"RX "
"(REO)\" is every frame the radio received; \"RX delivered\" counts only "
"frames for an AP or STA interface, so frames of an offloaded 802.11s mesh "
"link show up in the first column only."
msgstr "开机以来经过固件 Wi-Fi 数据通路的数据包，按射频统计。“接收（REO）”是射频收到的全部帧；“已交付接收”只统计发往 AP 或 STA 接口的帧，所以已卸载的 802.11s Mesh 链路的帧只出现在第一列。"

